      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naŋ Yecu nhiam Pay-lɛt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu buɔ̱n kɛɛliw rɔ jiɛc, kä cukɛ Yecu naŋ nhiam Pay-lɛt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ jɛ tok kɛ mi gɔanykɛ, jɛ wäkɛ i̱, “Cakɔ wut ɛmɛ jek nyonɛ do̱ra, kä penɛ kɔ ɣöö luɔ̱nykɔ Thii-thɛr tho̱lbo̱k, kä latdɛ jɛ ɛn ɣöö ɛ jɛn Mɛ-thia in la Kuäär.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pay-lɛt ɛ thiec i̱, “Ɛ ji̱n Kuäär ji̱ Juudh?” Cuɛ jɛ loc i̱, “Ci jɛ lar.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt bööth palä tin di̱t kɛnɛ buɔ̱n jiök i̱, “Thilɛ duer mi cä jek kä wut ɛmɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ kuɔk thi̱n, wäkɛ i̱, “Jɛn jakɛ naath kä nyuɔɔn, kɛ ŋi̱i̱cdɛ rɛy Ju-dia kɛɛliw, ni kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li gua̱a̱th in tookɛ jɛ thi̱n cu mäni wanɛ mɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yecu nhiam Ɣɛ-rod",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci Pay-lɛt mɛmɛ liŋ, cuɛ thiec mi wut ɛmɛ ɛ raan Gɛ̈-lɛ-li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cɛ jɛ ŋa̱c ɛn ɣöö ɛ raan rööl Ɣɛ-rod, cuɛ jɛ jäk kä Ɣɛ-rod mëë ci ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm ɛn ni̱ni tɔ̱tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ, mëë ci Ɣɛ-rod Yecu nɛn, cu lɔcdɛ tɛɛth ɛlɔ̱ŋ, kɛ ɣöö go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö derɛ jɛ nɛn kɛ gua̱a̱th mi bäär, kɛ ɣöö cɛ kɛ̈kdɛ liŋ. Kä go̱o̱rɛ ɣöö derɛ jɛ nɛn a lätdɛ nyuuth mi gääy naath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ jɛ thiëc kɛ gua̱a̱th mi bäär, kä thilɛ mi ci Yecu ɛ loc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä te bööth palä tin di̱t kɛnɛ ji̱ gɔ̱rkä cuŋä ɛn wanɔ, kä gɔanykɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu mäni Ɣɛ-rod kɛnɛ lathkëërikɛ cukɛ jɛ la̱t a jiäk, kä cukɛ jɛ buy. Cua jɛ jäk kä jɔk kä Pay-lɛt a ca jɛ rony kɛ bi̱i̱ mi gɔaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ cu Ɣɛ-rod kɛnɛ Pay-lɛt cua mäth, kä mëëdan kɛ ji̱ tɛ̈r.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuɛth Yecu li̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Pay-lɛt bööth palä tin di̱t kɛ bööth kɛnɛ naath cɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Cia wut ɛmɛ nöŋ ɣä, kɛ ɣöö ɛ ram mi bo̱th naath jɔ̱ɔ̱r. Kä kɛ kɔr kä mëë cä jɛ thɛm ni nhiamdun /ka̱n ɛ jek ɛn ɣöö te wut ɛmɛ kɛ duer kɛ ŋɔaani tin ci yɛn ɛ gɔny ni jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ mi ci Ɣɛ-rod ɛ jek kä jɛ bä, kɛ ɣöö cɛ jɛ jäk kä kɔn. Kä kɛ thuɔ̱k, thilɛ mi cɛ la̱t mi dee lia̱a̱ cop. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ ɣän bä jɛ duäc, kä bä jɛ lony.” [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ kɛ gua̱a̱th ti̱mä, la lunyɛ naath ram kɛl kä nɛy tin ca yian.]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni tëë wal cikɛ käth 17 mat thi̱n.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu kɛn diaal rɔal kɛɛl kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t i̱, “Naŋɛ wut ɛmɛ, kä luɔ̱nyɛ kɔ Bä-ra-bäth!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ɛ jɛn wut ëë ca la̱th dueel yieenä kɛ kui̱ rɔlä mi ci tuɔɔk rɛy wec, kɛnɛ luc ran.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pay-lɛt rɔ nyɔk kɛ ruac kɛ naath, kɛ ɣöö go̱o̱rɛ luɔ̱ny Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ wak kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t ɛlɔ̱ŋ i̱, “Pua̱tdɛ jɛ jiaath, pua̱tdɛ jɛ jiaath!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ kɛ jiök kɛ diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn, “Ɛŋu, mi jiääk ɛnɔ cɛ la̱t ɔ? /Ka̱n duer mi dee lia̱a̱ cop kä jɛ jek. Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ, ɣän bä jɛ duäc, kä bä jɛ lony.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ ŋot kɛ mi rɔalkɛ kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t ɛn ɣöö a jɛ pua̱tkɛ jiaath. Kä cua rɔaliɛn liŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Pay-lɛt ruac lat ɛn ɣöö ba min cikɛn ɛ thiec ka̱m kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ wut in ca thiec luɔ̱nykɛ, mëë ca yian kɛ kui̱ rɔlä kɛnɛ luc ran. Kä cuɛ Yecu ka̱m kɛ, kɛ ɣöö dee kɛn ɛ lät kä min go̱o̱r kɛn ɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Puɔ̱t Yecu jiaath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min naŋkɛ Yecu raar, cukɛ raan Thay-rin mi cɔal i̱ Thay-mɔn mi bëë rɛy ciëŋ käp, kä cukɛ jiath la̱th jɔɔkdɛ kɛ ɣöö bɛ jɛ kap kɔɔr Yecu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buɔ̱n nath mi di̱i̱t ɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r kä te män rɛydiɛn ti pa̱tkɛ lo̱ckiɛn, kä parkɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu rɔɔdɛ rietkɛ, cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Yɛn nyier Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, /cuarɛ wiee kɛ kui̱dä wieeɛ kɛ kui̱dun kɛnɛ gaatkun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö bi ni̱n ben ti bikɛ wee i̱, ‘Ca rol poth kɛnɛ män ti /ka̱n gaat met dap, kɛ thi̱n ti /ka̱n met luɛth.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bikɛ jɛ tok kɛ mi jiökɛ pääm i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:30",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ɣocä 10:8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Tɛ̈thɛ wi̱i̱da kä kuɔ̱mɛ kɔ piny.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö mi lätkɛ inɔ min ŋot jiath a tɔ̱c, ɛŋu mi bi tuɔɔk mi wä jiath wä kööt?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cua nɛy da̱ŋ rɛw ti ji̱ dueeri naŋ, kɛ ɣöö bakɛ wä näk kɛ jɛ kɛɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë cikɛ cop guäth mi cɔal i̱, “Pöör”, cukɛ jɛ pua̱t jiaath kɛnɛ ji̱ dueeri, te ram kɛl cueecdɛ, kä te ram min dɔ̱ŋ caamdɛ. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu wee i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 22:18.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Gua̱di̱n, päli kɛ ikä, kɛ ɣöö kui̱c kɛn min lät kɛn ɛ.”]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:34",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Tha̱a̱ŋ buɔkni tëë wal thilɛ kɛ riet kä ɣöö pälikɛ ikä kɛ ɣöö kui̱c kɛn min lät kɛn ɛ.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kä cukɛ bieynikɛ da̱a̱k kamnikiɛn kɛ yor gaakni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu naath cuɔ̱ŋ gekä, guɛckɛ jɛ. Kä cu bööth ɛ buy wäkɛ i̱, “Cɛ nɛy kɔ̱kiɛn kän. A jɛ kään rɔ, mi ɛ Mɛ-thia Kuɔth in cɛ mɛk.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu lathkëëri jɛ buy bä, cukɛ ben ka̱mkɛ jɛ kɔaŋ mi wac wac, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä jiökɛ jɛ i̱, “Mi ɛ ji̱n Kuäär ji̱ Juudh, kän rɔɔdu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tëëkɛ mi ca gɔ̱r nhial wi̱i̱dɛ i̱, “Mɛmɛ ɛ Kuäär ji̱ Juudh.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu gua̱n dui̱rä kɛl mi ca pua̱t jiaath jɛ kuëth wëë i̱, “/Ciɛ ji̱n Mɛ-thia? Kän rɔɔdu, amäni kɔn!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu wut in dɔ̱diɛn jɛ gak, wëë i̱, “Thilɛ ji̱ dual kɛ Kuoth, cäŋ nɛni jɛ i̱ ca ji̱ kuɛ̈th li̱th ce̱tkɛ jɛ? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ ɛn kuɛthdan li̱th, kɛ ɣöö jek kɔn ni min ro̱ŋ kɛ lätkɔn, kä thilɛ mi jiääk mi ci wut ɛmɛ jɛ la̱t.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Yecu jiök i̱, “Yecu tim ɣä mi wi̱i̱ wä cop rɛy kuäärädu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Ɛpuc, ɣän la̱rä jɛ ji̱, ɛn walɛ bi tekɛ ɣä kɛɛl cieŋ Kuɔth mi gɔaa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lia̱a̱ Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci ɣɔw a cäŋ däär, cu piny kɛɛliw cuɔl cu mäni bua̱k ca̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci cäŋ kony däär, cu bi̱i̱ luaak Kuɔth in di̱i̱t rɛ̈ɛ̈t ni däär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu wak kɛ jɔw mi di̱i̱t, wëë i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:46",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 31:5.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Gua̱di̱n, ɣän kuëŋä yiëëdä tetädu.” Mëë cɛ nɔmɔ lar, cuɛ yiëëdɛ in jɔakdiɛn cu ŋök raar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci kuäär rɛ̈m min ci tuɔɔk nɛn, cuɛ Kuoth liak, kä cuɛ wee i̱, “Ɛpuc, wut ɛmɛ thilɛ jɛ duer.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci buɔ̱n kɛɛliw mëë ci rɔ dol min ci tuɔɔk nɛn, cukɛ loc ciëëŋnikiɛn a pa̱tkɛ kathkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy diaal tëë ŋa̱ckɛ Yecu amäni män tëë guɔ̱ɔ̱rkɛ jɛ kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li cuɔ̱ŋ ɛ na̱n, guɛckɛ ti̱ti̱ diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuɔ̱ny Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ tëëkɛ wut mi gɔaa kä gua̱n cuŋni mi cɔali Jo-thɛp, cäŋ ni mëë ɛ ram kɛl kä bööth luɔ̱k. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jɛn /kenɛ ca̱a̱pkiɛn lätkiɛn nhɔk. Kä bëë wi̱c ji̱ Juudh mi cɔali A-ri-ma-thia kä liipɛ ni ben kuäärä Kuɔth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu wut ɛmɔ wä kä Pay-lɛt, kä cuɛ puɔ̱ny Yecu wä thiec kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ wä luɔny piny, kä cuɛ jɛ rith kɛ bi̱i̱ mi puɔth puɔth. Kä cuɛ jɛ tɔa̱a̱c rɛy kɔ̱kä pa̱a̱m mi ca guaŋ kä /ka̱n raan met kony thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛ cäŋ riali ŋɔaani ikä, kä ci cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä tuɔɔk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu män tëë bä kɛɛl kɛ Yecu kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li wä kɔɔr. Cukɛ gua̱a̱th kunyädɛ wä nɛn kɛnɛ tɔ̱ɔ̱c ëë ca tɔ̱ɔ̱c ni puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cukɛ loc jɔk, kä cukɛ wal kɛnɛ liɛɛth yi̱i̱rä wä rialikä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 23:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ lɔ̱ɔ̱ŋ kɛ cäŋ lɔ̱ŋä, ce̱tkɛ ŋut.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.23.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.23.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
